license: MIT

keywords:
  - Stata
  - BUMIDAS
  - mixed-frequency
  - MIDAS
  - forecasting
  - temporal aggregation
  - econometrics

abstract: >-
  Stata commands for Bottom-Up Mixed-Frequency Data Sampling (BUMIDAS).
  The package provides bumidas for estimation and model selection and
  mfcollapse for constructing mixed-frequency data, together with examples,
  certification tests, simulations, and an empirical application.

